  "story": {
    "day": 81,
    "title": "Kaya's Afternoon",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya came home from elementary school this afternoon.",
      "She was hungry and had a slight headache.",
      "Her mom, an office worker, was still out before.",
      "Kaya sat on the floor, watching a video of a video game.",
      "It showed firefighters and a kind police officer from beautiful Hong Kong.",
      "Her favorite was dad's delicious radish soup recipe from South Korea.",
      "Her young grandfather then made a video call from California.",
      "They always talked about these great things around Christmas or New Year's Day.",
      "He spoke of a trumpet player in Mexico and social studies topics.",
      "\"Uh-huh, I listen well. Pardon?\" Kaya said. \"Are you okay?\"",
      "She decided to get up and bathe in the lovely bath.",
      "Before, she hoped to have candy from the supermarket for her basketball teammate."
    ]
  }
}